cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "HyperCross: a protocol-first scientific hyperspectral representation benchmark"
abstract: >-
  A protocol-first benchmark and experiment suite for small-sample scientific
  hyperspectral imaging, covering whole-leaf hyperspectral regression
  (HyperLeaf2024) and patient-grouped histology classification
  (HistologyHSI-GB) under group-disjoint protocols.
type: software
license: MIT
